		{"id":"d487346ba356080a","x":-507,"y":-378,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Valrich Torvier.canvas]]\n#NPC"},
		{"id":"56ae570729b90896","x":-540,"y":-240,"width":705,"height":490,"type":"text","text":"Once known as Lillette Torvier now Revilya the Arch Fey.\n\n\nRevilya is Chaotic neutral character currently in a pact with Valrich Torvier.\n\nShe was once Lillette Torvier but after the accident Lillette was blasted into the Feywild and woke up with new power and a desire to play tricks and have fun. Although her memory remains her personality is completely different than that of Lillette and her motives are not the same. \n\nRevilya seeks to protect the Feywild and rid it of those who practice evil deeds within it her connection with Valrich is so that he can one day help her with her goal. Additionally she wants to eventually be able to cross freely between the material plane and the Feywild, she wants to be able to spend time with her family even though she is now an Arch Fey. She has no idea how she became one and has no idea how to revert it even if she wanted to. Her life goal is to keep her domain safe and fun while spreading her new personality across the world and thrive on the chaos it causes for each time she makes someone laugh or feel uncomfortable in funny situations she herself gains more power. Power she can intern use to protect her domain and the friends she has living in it.\n"},
		{"id":"96e7dab68a7e40e1","x":200,"y":-240,"width":680,"height":1014,"type":"file","file":"Player Characters/Images/Pasted image 20260915204631.png"}
